; Program 3.1: Integer part of x (1 < x < 10^8)
; Source: Дьяконов, «Справочник по расчётам на микрокалькуляторах», 1985, p.56 (book61.pdf page 57)
; Input: x in X.  Output: int(x) in X.
; The book writes the register as M (M = 7, 8, 9, A, B, C or Д); this listing uses M = 7.
; КИП7 truncates R7 to its integer part (R7..Rd are not incremented/decremented);
; the value it loads (from "register" int(x)) is junk and is discarded.
; The book prints no worked example for this program.
;
; expected value computed, not printed in the book
; @input 123.4567
; @expect X=123
;
00: П7 КИП7 ИП7 С/П
